UID:040000008200E00074C5B7101A82E00800000000CD4CE291CB0FDD0100000000000000
 00100000000C7C8DD4D1D22C459E94BFAF95D36E10-vDDDTypes(2026-07-27 10-00-00+0
 2-00\, Parameters({'TZID'- 'Romance Standard Time'}))
SEQUENCE:2
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Dear all\,\nAs previously mentioned\, this 2-episodes meeting 
 will be dedicated to presenting and discussing the proposed strategy for t
 he LNP Application area\, covering key computational developments\, associ
 ated bio-validation activities\, and proprietary bioassets.\nInitial budge
 t estimates will also be shared and subsequently refined with the Finance 
 team.\nGiven the holiday period\, it has not been possible to find a slot 
 where everyone is available. This meeting should therefore be considered a
  first iteration focused on short-term activities\, to be followed by a se
 cond session in early September to review strategic directions (2-3 years)
  and kick off the approved projects.\nAll documents will be shared in the 
 dedicated Slack channel #lnp-roadmap\nLucia\n\n___________________________
